WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.780
Privacy focuses on how personal information is collected, used, retained, disclosed, and disposed of.

2
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:17.180
Organizations that process personal information often implement controls that support transparency, accountability, appropriate use, and protection of personal data.

3
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:27.780
Privacy considerations may overlap with security and confidentiality controls, but privacy is specifically concerned with personal information and expectations about its handling.

4
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:43.660
For teams building and operating services, privacy may involve data minimization, notice, consent where appropriate, access handling, retention limits, disposal processes, and review of how personal information flows through systems.
